WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.004 --> 00:00:05.595
Add and reorder chapters

2
00:00:06.103 --> 00:00:11.103
The chapter list runs down the left: front matter, the body, then back matter.

3
00:00:11.104 --> 00:00:17.647
To add a chapter, use Add new chapter at the foot of the list.

4
00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:25.645
Give it a title, and start writing. It saves a moment after you stop typing.

5
00:00:25.647 --> 00:00:34.819
The + beside each section adds a part divider, a foreword, a glossary and more.

6
00:00:34.822 --> 00:00:43.678
Drag the dotted handle to move a chapter. The numbers update by themselves.

7
00:00:43.681 --> 00:00:51.057
Hide the list when you want more room to write.
